        'steps.win11NotPossible'   = 'Explain it calmly: the PC keeps working, but gets no security updates. | Advise a newer PC for banking and email; this one can stay for simple things. | Until then: keep the virus scanner on. | Offer to set up the new PC and move the files over (a separate job).'
